# Champion of the Clachan (CR 601.2b, 701.4a, 607.2q): the additional cost beholds a Kithkin - Figure of Destiny, revealed
# from the hand - and exiles it. The Champion is cast with three Moxen and a Plains for {3}{W}. When Bot2's Swords to
# Plowshares exiles it, the exiled Figure of Destiny returns to its owner's hand.

